cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Qimchi-Connect using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Qimchi-Connect: Publish and discover live xarray datasets in Qimchi"
abstract: >-
  Qimchi-Connect publishes snapshots of running measurements to Qimchi as
  xarray datasets for live plotting. It supports custom measurement code
  and includes providers for QCoDeS, Qanary and Quantify.
